WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.690
At dawn, people step
into the Ganges to bathe.

2
00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:06.280
Many call the river Mother Ganga.

3
00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:11.000
In a courtyard, a family waters a
small holy basil plant each day,

4
00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.590
and walks around it.

5
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:16.380
Many Hindus honour the cow
as a mother who gives milk.

6
00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:21.240
Could things like these, or a
teacher, help someone worship one God?

7
00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.180
In this mission, you'll
find out what a murti is,

8
00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:27.140
and why Hindus say it is not an idol.

9
00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:32.290
Then you'll read a passage from the Gita
about what a stilled mind comes to see.

10
00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.650
Your mission: find out how rivers, plants,

11
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:39.470
animals and teachers can be
part of worshipping one God.
